messages[14]{user,text}:
  user_1,[00:00] Hello? Um, hi, is this Sunita?
  user_2,[00:03] Hi Samar, yes this is Sunita from Protect All Agency, can you hear me okay?
  user_1,[00:07] Yeah, I can hear you. Sorry, I was just... [typing] looking for my policy number.
  user_2,[00:12] No problem, take your time.
  user_1,[00:20] Got it. It's H-2026-0459.
  user_2,[00:23] Thanks. So this is regarding your home insurance policy, correct?
  user_1,[00:27] Yes, I just moved into a new flat in Sector 5, and I wanted to make sure the policy is active.
  user_2,[00:32] Absolutely, we have the paperwork ready. Just need to confirm a few details—like the property address and any recent renovations?
  user_1,[00:38] The address is 12B, Greenview Apartments, Sector 5, Kolkata. No renovations yet, just the standard... um... kitchen cabinets installed last month.
  user_2,[00:45] Got it. Kitchen cabinets are covered under the standard contents, so you're good. Also, do you have a security system installed?
  user_1,[00:51] Yeah, we have a basic alarm system, installed by SafeHome.
  user_2,[00:55] Perfect. With that, the policy will be active from today. I'll send you a confirmation email shortly. Anything else I can help with?
  user_1,[01:02] No, that's all. Thanks!
  user_2,[01:05] You're welcome! Have a great day.